  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The correct sequence of electron gain enthalpy of the elements listed below is</p><p>A. Ar&nbsp;&nbsp;B. Br&nbsp;&nbsp;C. F&nbsp;&nbsp;D. S</p><p>Choose the most appropriate from the options given below:</p>"
  },
  "options": [
